Package: newminhh
Architecture: x32 amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: binfmt-support, systemd
Description: Container-less i386 Compatibility System for x32-Only Linux
 newminhh executes 32-bit x86 (i386) binaries inside an x32 address space
 using hybrid static ELF rewriting, direct cdecl-to-x32 trampolines, and
 in-process DBT. This package also provides binfmt_misc integration and
 initramfs hooks.
